<FTL>
<event name="BOON_SELECT_OE_AUX_SHIELDS">
	<text>From nowhere, you hear a voice speaking to you. "Grant of [Auxiliary Shielding] i-i-installed. Installed! Grant provides: A s-s-single layer of energy shields, stacks with other energy shields. If -you- witness p-p-previous challenger; provide thanks. I advise you -visit- me as well."</text>
	<hiddenAug>BOON_OE_AUX_SHIELDS</hiddenAug>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Continue...</text>
		<event>
			<loadEvent>BOON_SELECT_CONTINUE</loadEvent>
		</event>
	</choice>
</event>
</FTL>